## P18-V01 source/API correction

- Pinned `DefaultMQPushConsumerImpl` exposes `getmQClientFactory()` and
  `setmQClientFactory(MQClientInstance)` separately from
  `RebalanceImpl.getmQClientFactory/setmQClientFactory`. Its implementation
  fixture already records initial null and assigned-object identity.
- Added `get_implementation_client_runtime` and
  `set_implementation_client_runtime` with a distinct nullable slot from the
  rebalance factory. Startup initializes both slots with the manager-created
  runtime; Push runtime contexts and task scheduling use an explicit
  implementation override. Registration and lifecycle leases remain tied to
  the startup `ClientRuntimeManager`.
- Added `implementation_factory_setter_is_independent_of_rebalance_factory`
  for initial null, identity replacement, explicit null, and slot independence.
  Updated the Phase 10 and Phase 18 compatibility crosswalks and appended the
  review record to `docs/release-checklist.md`.

